===Etymology===
{{etydate|11th century}}. From {{inh|de|gmh|heimuote}}, {{m|gmh|heimüete}}, from {{inh|de|goh|heimōti}}, {{m|goh|heimuoti}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*haimōdī|t=homeland}}. Compare {{cog|bar|Hoamat}}, {{cog|sli|Heemte}}.

